'''Horrorpotamus''' (デッカーバチャン, ''Dekkābachan Kyōshū'', '''Giant Dekkābachan's Assault!''') is an event added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Horrorpotamus will reset when the event ends, allowing the player to collect the rewards again once the event returns. The boss of this Gauntlet is [[Super Hyppoh]], a variant of [[Hyppoh]] with a lot more knockbacks, long-reaching Omni Strikes, and a 100% chance to slow Cat Units.

==Overview==
===About===
Horrorpotamus contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Cosmic Juggernaut Lvs'''. After beating three Cosmic Juggernaut Lvs, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one. (30 minutes for one available) Rewards for the first completion of a Cosmic Juggernaut Lv can include XP, [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Gamatoto Expedition|Catamins]] and [[Ototo Corps|Materials]]. Every 20 Cosmic Juggernaut Lvs plays out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP are increased with each level.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Horrorpotamus/Cosmic Juggernaut Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Horrorpotamus is unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

